Z||000000||V8Fiero||06-20-2001||08:58 PM||||First off I would like to formerly THANK Doug for the Excellent business transaction. I just returned from picking up a Red 86GT from him in WV. Exactly how he said it was. A great car with very little work will be excellent. <P>Here it is being loaded on the tow dolly getting ready for the long journey (1400 miles one way)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jun20$01.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jun20$02.jpg"> <BR>Heres the setup at the hotel parking lot on the way home.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jun20$03.jpg"> <BR>And here it sits in my driveway awaiting the engine transfer.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jun20$04.jpg"> <BR>And here is Dougs Baby. I offered my Van and the GT for it....but for some reason he didnt go for it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Nice car Doug.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jun20$05.jpg"> <P>I highly recommend the FieroWarehouse for ANYTHING to do with Fieros. Thanks again Doug...<P>Scott<P>||||reg||14
